# Aggregate compliance evidence

After pack scans — **script only** (no manual jq in chat):

```bash
bash "$CCE_PACK_DIR/compliance-aggregate.sh" "$WORK_ROOT" "$WORK_ROOT/compliance-evidence.json"
```

`note()` stdout: `compliance_evidence_path`, `total_call_sites`, `regulatory_touchpoint_count`. Optional baseline compare: read `baseline_artifact_path` input, `note(new_since_baseline)` as integer delta only.

Do not paste per-repo `cce-*.json` bodies.
